## MCP Server Deployment Configuration
##
## These variables are forwarded into deployed MCP server containers via
## deploy.sh and docker-compose. They configure authentication, data access,
## tool search, and execution policy at runtime.
##
## Copy this file to .env.server and fill in values for your deployment.

## === Authentication ===

## Entra ID application configuration for MCP code execution servers.
## Required for token validation in deployed environments.
# ENTRA_CLIENT_ID="<your-entra-app-client-id>"
# ENTRA_TENANT_ID="<your-entra-tenant-id>"

## Managed Identity client ID (Azure Container Apps).
# AZURE_CLIENT_ID="<your-user-assigned-managed-identity-client-id>"

## Optional: Specify resource and client ID for managed identity
# DEFAULT_IDENTITY_RESOURCE_ID="/subscriptions/<subscription-id>/resourceGroups/<rg>/providers/Microsoft.ManagedIdentity/userAssignedIdentities/<identity-name>"
# DEFAULT_IDENTITY_CLIENT_ID="<your-managed-identity-client-id>"

## Authentication scope for MCP server-to-server calls
# MCP_SERVER_SCOPE="api://<your-entra-app-client-id>/.default"

## === API Key Authentication (for OSS / non-Entra environments) ===
## When set, the corresponding service uses key-based auth instead of Entra ID.

## Azure AI Search query or admin key
# AZURE_SEARCH_API_KEY="your-search-api-key"

## Azure OpenAI API key (for tool search vectorization without Entra)
# AZURE_OPENAI_API_KEY="your-aoai-api-key"

## === Data Lake / Artifact Registry ===

## Azure AI Search endpoint for artifact registry
# DATA_LAKE_SEARCH_ENDPOINT="https://<your-search-service>.search.windows.net"

## Blob details index name (default: blob-details)
# DATA_LAKE_BLOB_DETAILS_INDEX="blob-details"

## === Tool Search ===

## Azure AI Search-based tool discovery (alternative to BM25)
# TOOL_SEARCH_ENDPOINT="https://<your-search-service>.search.windows.net"

## Azure OpenAI model for tool description vectorization
# TOOL_SEARCH_VECTORIZER_ENDPOINT="https://<your-aoai-resource>.cognitiveservices.azure.com/openai/deployments/<deployment>/embeddings?api-version=2023-05-15"
# TOOL_SEARCH_VECTORIZER_DEPLOYMENT="text-embedding-3-large"

## AOAI scope for tool search authentication
# AOAI_SCOPE="https://cognitiveservices.azure.com/.default"

## === Execution Policy ===
## These serve as deployment-wide defaults. A ServerConfig value (when set)
## takes precedence over these env vars.

## Maximum parallel code executions (0 = unlimited; default for ServerConfig.parallel_max_concurrency)
# PARALLEL_EXECUTE_MAX_CONCURRENCY=0

## Max characters per output stream before truncation (default for ServerConfig.output_truncation_threshold)
# CODE_OUTPUT_TRUNCATION_THRESHOLD=50000

## === Server Infrastructure ===

## Public base URL for OAuth protected-resource metadata (e.g., behind a load balancer)
# PUBLIC_BASE_URL="https://<your-app>.azurecontainerapps.io"

## Activity event publishing endpoint (no-op when unset)
# ACTIVITY_UI_URL="https://<your-activity-ui>.azurecontainerapps.io"
# ACTIVITY_UI_AUDIENCE="api://<your-activity-ui-app-id>"
# ACTIVITY_UI_CLIENT_ID="<your-activity-ui-client-id>"

## Trusted HTTP hosts for cross-server object transfer (comma-separated)
# OBJECT_TRANSFER_TRUSTED_HTTP_HOSTS="chemistry-server,energysystems-server"

## === Environment Build Overrides ===
## Advanced knobs for customizing the MCP server's Python environment build.

## Override the ipykernel requirement spec
# MCP_IPYKERNEL_REQUIREMENT="ipykernel>=6.29"

## Path to a local wheelhouse directory for offline pip installs
# MCP_WHEELHOUSE="/path/to/wheelhouse"

## Override the asset cache directory (default: ~/.cache/mcp-envs/<name>)
# MCP_ASSET_CACHE_DIR="/custom/cache/path"

## === Blob Download Tuning ===

## Max concurrent blob download connections (default: 8)
# MCP_BLOB_MAX_CONCURRENCY=8

## Blob download chunk size in bytes (default: 4MB)
# MCP_BLOB_CHUNK_SIZE=4194304

## Max single-get size in bytes (default: 32MB)
# MCP_BLOB_MAX_SINGLE_GET=33554432

## === Deployment Infrastructure (used by deploy.sh only) ===
## These configure Azure Container Apps provisioning and are NOT forwarded
## into the running container.

# ACA_RESOURCE_GROUP="<your-resource-group>"
# ACA_ACR_NAME="<your-acr-name>"
# ACA_ENVIRONMENT_NAME="<your-aca-environment>"
# ACA_IDENTITY_ID="/subscriptions/<subscription-id>/resourceGroups/<rg>/providers/Microsoft.ManagedIdentity/userAssignedIdentities/<identity-name>"
# ACA_IDENTITY_CLIENT_ID="<your-identity-client-id>"
# ACA_STORAGE_LINK="<your-storage-link>"
# ACA_CACHE_MOUNT_PATH="/home/appuser/.cache/mcp-envs"
